# GS-012: A finite alkali trap eventually allows CO2 breakthrough
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
seal v1 100mL
measure v1 pressure
add v1 CO2 0.00025mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 pressure
add v1 CO2 0.00075mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 pressure
add v1 CO2 0.002mol
measure v1 ph
measure v1 pressure
inspect
